    "Jobs run Blip automatically when due — even if the notch panel is closed.": {
      "comment": "A description of the jobs that run automatically.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jobs führen Blip automatisch aus, wenn sie fällig sind – auch wenn das Notch-Fenster geschlossen ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
