    "Nearby Share allows you to share files from Android phones to your Mac using Android's native file sharing (Nearby Share / Quick Share). It's recommended to keep this feature enabled for convenient sharing from family and friends.": {
      "comment": "Settings interface",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit Nearby Share können Sie Dateien von Android-Smartphones über die native Android-Dateifreigabe (Nearby Share / Quick Share) mit Ihrem Mac teilen. Es wird empfohlen, diese Funktion aktiviert zu lassen, um bequem mit Familie und Freunden zu teilen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby Share allows you to share files from Android phones to your Mac using Android's native file sharing (Nearby Share / Quick Share). It's recommended to keep this feature enabled for convenient sharing from family and friends."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby Share te permite compartir archivos desde teléfonos Android a tu Mac con el uso compartido de archivos nativo de Android (Nearby Share / Quick Share). Se recomienda mantener esta función activada para compartir cómodamente con familiares y amigos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby Share vous permet de partager des fichiers depuis des téléphones Android vers votre Mac à l’aide du partage de fichiers natif d’Android (Nearby Share / Quick Share). Il est recommandé de garder cette fonctionnalité activée pour un partage pratique avec la famille et les amis."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby Share ti permette di condividere file dai telefoni Android al tuo Mac usando la condivisione file nativa di Android (Nearby Share / Quick Share). Si consiglia di tenere attiva questa funzione per condividere comodamente con familiari e amici."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby Shareを使うと、Androidのネイティブなファイル共有(Nearby Share / クイック共有)を使って、AndroidスマートフォンからMacにファイルを共有できます。家族や友人から手軽に共有できるよう、この機能を有効にしておくことをおすすめします。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "근처 공유를 사용하면 Android의 기본 파일 공유(Nearby Share/Quick Share)로 Android 휴대전화에서 Mac으로 파일을 공유할 수 있습니다. 가족과 친구가 편리하게 공유할 수 있도록 이 기능을 켜 두는 것이 좋습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Nearby Share permite compartilhar arquivos de celulares Android com o Mac usando o compartilhamento de arquivos nativo do Android (Nearby Share / Quick Share). É recomendado manter este recurso ativado para compartilhar com facilidade com familiares e amigos."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby Share позволяет передавать файлы с телефонов Android на ваш Mac с помощью встроенной функции Android (Nearby Share / Quick Share). Рекомендуем оставить её включённой для удобного обмена с родными и друзьями."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "附近分享让你通过 Android 原生文件共享（Nearby Share / Quick Share）将文件从 Android 手机发送到 Mac。建议保持启用，方便与亲友共享文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nearby Share 可讓你使用 Android 原生的檔案分享功能（Nearby Share／Quick Share），將檔案從 Android 手機傳送到 Mac。建議保持啟用，方便親友分享檔案給你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
