    "Settings ▸ Fractal Windows ▸ General ▸ macOS Features has Turn Back On.": {
      "comment": "A description of the macOS settings that can be changed to change the state of macOS features that may interfere with Fractal Windows.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
